Package: ecosanctuary
Title: Build Reusable Quarto and Moodle Question Banks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Javad", "Vahdat Atashgah",
           email = "82263273+vahdatjavad@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for validating, selecting, assembling, and rendering
    reusable question banks. Question metadata are stored in a portable comma
    separated index, while questions are authored as Quarto or R Markdown
    fragments. A single selection can be rendered as a Moodle quiz, a student
    practice document, and a teacher answer key.
